  "proof_boundary_zh": "这些用例只使用合成状态验证 RailWeave 织入契约的失败关闭逻辑。PASS 不证明现场绩效、法律合规、公共安全、无障碍质量、采购可行性、专业审定或实施授权。",
  "proof_boundary_en": "These cases use synthetic states only to verify fail-closed logic in the RailWeave weave contracts. PASS does not prove field performance, legal compliance, public safety, accessibility quality, procurement feasibility, professional approval, or implementation authority.",
